% PROVENANCE RULE FOR THIS FILE. Nothing here was reconstructed from memory
% and left standing. Each entry records, in its comment, which fields were
% checked against the arXiv abstract page and which are attested only by
% this project's research log. Fields that could be neither checked nor
% attested were DELETED rather than guessed -- an invented volume number or
% DOI in a bibliography is a fabricated citation, and it is invisible to
% every gate in this repository. Two entries below were written wrong on the
% first pass and corrected against the source: the author of the Schmidt
% paper, and the title, author list and subject of both 2025/2026 preprints.
% ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

% VERIFIED against arXiv:2511.02733 (title, all three authors incl. middle
